      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_LucasNeedsYourHelp",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Lucas needs your help!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Louka a besoin de ton aide!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_WhatsWithThisOldTimer",
      "en_US": [
        "Ow! Ouch!\n",
        "What’s with this old-timer?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": "Aïe, ouille! Doucement, grand-père!"
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_DawnICouldntBeatThisPerson",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "It’s T-Team Galactic!\r",
        "They’re taking the Pokémon of the\n",
        "lake...\r",
        "I...\n",
        "I couldn’t beat this person..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "C’est... c’est la Team Galaxie!\r",
        "Ils ont capturé le Pokémon du lac...\n",
        "Je... je n’ai rien pu faire..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_LucasILostToHerButJustBarely",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: It’s Team Galactic!\n",
        "They took the Pokémon of the lake...\r",
        "This woman...\n",
        "I lost to her, but just barely!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: C’est la Team Galaxie!\n",
        "Ils ont capturé le Pokémon du lac...\r",
        "Et dire que j’étais à deux doigts de\n",
        "battre cette harpie!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_MarsIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Mars: That face...!\n",
        "It brings back bad memories!\r",
        "I’m talking about the windworks!\r",
        "I caught a whole lot of trouble\n",
        "for that little incident.\r",
        "What’s with that look on your face?\n",
        "You do remember me, don’t you?\r",
        "Fine, whatever.\n",
        "I’ll tell you who I am again!\r",
        "I’m Mars, one of Team Galactic’s\n",
        "Commanders.\r",
        "So, what is it? Are you some\n",
        "lovey-dovey couple to the rescue?\r",
        "Not a chance! Not even a teeny one!\n",
        "You’re all going down!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Mars: Ce visage...!\n",
        "Ça me rappelle de mauvais souvenirs!\r",
        "Je parle des Eoliennes!\r",
        "J’ai eu pas mal d’ennuis \n",
        "après cet incident!\r",
        "Pourquoi tu fais cette tête? \n",
        "Tu ne te souviens pas?\r",
        "Bah, peu importe.\n",
        "Je vais te rappeler qui je suis!\r",
        "Je suis Mars, un des Commandants \n",
        "de la Team Galaxie.\r",
        "Alors, vous nous faites quoi? Le joli \n",
        "petit couple qui vient à la rescousse?\r",
        "Aucune chance! Vous pouvez toujours \n",
        "rêver! Je vais vous donner une leçon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_MarsDefeat",
      "en_US": [
        "I lost again...\r",
        "So, first the windworks, and now\n",
        "Lake Verity that I owe you for!\r",
        "This shouldn’t be happening to Team\n",
        "Galactic’s Commander...\r",
        "...Calm down, Mars...\n",
        "I’ve done my part in all of this...\r",
        "My mission was to transport the\n",
        "lake’s Pokémon to our HQ...\r",
        "...That’s right! I accomplished my\n",
        "mission without a problem!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Et voilà, j’ai encore perdu...\r",
        "D’abord les Eoliennes, et \n",
        "maintenant le Lac Vérité!\r",
        "Je suis quand même le \n",
        "Commandant Mars quoi, zut!\r",
        "Calme-toi, Mars, calme-toi...\n",
        "Tu as rempli ta mission...\r",
        "Le Pokémon du lac a été \n",
        "transporté au QG...\r",
        "Mais oui! Je m’en fiche, la \n",
        "mission est un succès total!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_WerePullingOut",
      "en_US": [
        "Team! We’re pulling out!\n",
        "The boss is waiting at the HQ!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Allez! On y va!\n",
        "Le chef nous attend au QG!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_NowWeveGotAllLakePokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "The Pokémon of the three lakes are\n",
        "connected somehow.\r",
        "Thanks to Saturn’s grandstanding at\n",
        "Lake Valor, a cavern appeared here.\r",
        "It was the cavern where the Pokémon\n",
        "MESPRIT slept.\r",
        "MESPRIT appeared, too, probably to\n",
        "go help its friends.\r",
        "That worked out well for us.\n",
        "It was super easy to catch.\r",
        "So, now we’ve got them all:\n",
        "MESPRIT, “The Being of Emotion.”\f",
        "AZELF, “The Being of Willpower.”\f",
        "UXIE, “The Being of Intelligence.”\r",
        "Now that we have them all...\r",
        "You can look forward to what plans\n",
        "Team Galactic has for them!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Un lien unit les Pokémon\n",
        "des trois lacs.\r",
        "Grâce à l’action de Saturne au Lac \n",
        "Courage, une caverne est apparue ici.\r",
        "C’était la tanière du \n",
        "Pokémon CREFOLLET.\r",
        "Quand CREFOLLET est apparu pour aider \n",
        "ses amis, nous l’avons attrapé.\r",
        "Ça n’a pas été bien dur, tout a marché \n",
        "comme sur des roulettes.\r",
        "Maintenant, nous les avons tous:\n",
        "CREFOLLET, “être de l’émotion”.\f",
        "CREFADET, “être de la volonté”.\f",
        "CREHELF, “être du savoir”.\r",
        "Maintenant qu’ils sont à nous...\r",
        "La Team Galaxie va pouvoir \n",
        "mettre son plan à exécution!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_WhatIsHappeningAtLakeAcuity",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: I see...\n",
        "This also occurred at Lake Valor...\r",
        "Another legendary Pokémon was taken\n",
        "away by Team Galactic...\r",
        "Both of you went up against\n",
        "full-fledged criminals...\r",
        "The fact that you’re unharmed is\n",
        "reason enough to celebrate.\r",
        "...But what about {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\r",
        "What is happening at Lake Acuity?\n",
        "Is {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} safe?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: Je vois... Il est arrivé la\n",
        "même chose au Lac Courage...\r",
        "Un autre Pokémon légendaire a \n",
        "été capturé par la Team Galaxie...\r",
        "Vous vous êtes tous les deux \n",
        "mesurés à de vrais criminels...\r",
        "Vous êtes sains et saufs, c’est\n",
        "le principal.\r",
        "Mais qu’en est-il du Lac Savoir?\n",
        "Est-ce que {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} va bien?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_GoToLakeAcuity",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, I need you to\n",
        "go to Lake Acuity right away.\r",
        "I’m worried about {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Sorbier: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, tu dois te \n",
        "rendre au Lac Savoir tout de suite.\r",
        "Je m’inquiète pour {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_DawnWhatIsTeamGalacticUpTo",
      "en_US": [
        "Dawn: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, what is Team\n",
        "Galactic up to?\r",
        "Are the abducted Pokémon of the\n",
        "lakes going to be OK?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Aurore: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, que prépare \n",
        "la Team Galaxie?\r",
        "Tu crois qu’ils vont faire du mal \n",
        "aux Pokémon légendaires?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "LakeVerity_Text_LucasWhatsGalacticUpTo",
      "en_US": [
        "Lucas: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, what’s Team\n",
        "Galactic up to?\r",
        "They’d better not harm the Pokémon\n",
        "they took from the lakes..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Louka: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, que prépare \n",
        "la Team Galaxie?\r",
        "Ils ont intérêt à ne faire aucun mal \n",
        "aux Pokémon légendaires, sinon..."
      ]
    }
  ]
}